  "description": "The Basher bike was first introduced to the SE line during the first BMX boom and the brands inception. This legendary bike is making its return this year in multiple new sizes built specifically for kids. The new 16\" Bashers stylish and lightweight frame is built with 6061 aluminum and features a low standover, legendary Looptail rear end, and retro dropouts. The combination of removable training wheels, coaster brake, and hand brake will help new riders build confidence in style when going out on new adventures and riding over their first jumps.",
